        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cadmium, semiconductor-grade, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cadmium, semiconductor-grade, at plant
This datasets describes the production of high-grade cadmium (99.9999%) from metalurgical cadmium. This purity of cadmium can be used in the production of various cadmium compounds. ;
CAS number: 000744-43-9; 
Formula: Cd; 
UUID: 48a25aa7-777b-37c2-bae9-bb1db526f73d
The energy consumption and transports are considered for, emissions are estimated.
Location: Production in GLO.
Technology: Production of high-purity cadmium by vacuum distillation
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature and own estimations 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_48a25aa7-777b-37c2-bae9-bb1db526f73d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
